  "notes": "Ingredion Incorporated (NYSE: INGR) \u2014 global ingredient solutions company that processes corn, tapioca, potato, rice, and other grains/tubers into starches, sweeteners (HFCS, dextrose), specialty ingredients, plant-based proteins, and texturizers. Serves food, beverage, brewing, paper, and pharma customers. Four reporting segments since FY24: Texture & Healthful Solutions (T&HS), Food & Industrial Ingredients LATAM (F&II LATAM), Food & Industrial Ingredients US/Canada (F&II US/C), and All Other (incl. PureCircle stevia). Spun off South Korean operations / divested PureCircle stevia partially during FY24. Fiscal year = calendar. SEC CIK 1046257. 10-Ks at sec.gov.",
